="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Patient age (&#x0003c;50 years <italic>vs</italic> &#x0003e;51 years)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.0008</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.525</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.246&#x02013;1.121</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.0959</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Clinical stage (stage I <italic>vs</italic> stage II/III/IV)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.0001</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.050</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.011&#x02013;0.223</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.0001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Histological grade (grade 1 <italic>vs</italic> grade 2/3)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.0043</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.705</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.371&#x02013;1.342</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.2872</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">TADG-15 expression (positive <italic>vs</italic> negative)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.0480</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.097</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.577&#x02013;2.087</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.7768</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote3"><label>a</label><p>Log-rank test.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote4"><label>b</label><p>Cox proportional hazard model.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote5"><label>c</label><p>RR, risk ratio.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote6"><label>d</label><p>CI, 95&#x00025; confidence interval.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Relative expression lev